        "title": "refactor(security): consolidate secret primitives",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\nSecret display masking and constant-time secret comparison were split across generic utilities, plugin-local wrappers, and ad hoc forwarding helpers. That duplicated security-sensitive contracts and made exact behavior harder to audit.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\n- Move API-key and prefix-only secret display policies into the security owner boundary while preserving their distinct empty, short-value, control-character, prefix/suffix, and UTF-16 code-unit behavior.\n- Keep constant-time string comparison as exact padded UTF-8 byte equality, including unconditional equal-length `timingSafeEqual` input and explicit original-length rejection.\n- Remove Browser, Voice Call, Webhooks, and Zalo forwarding wrappers so callers use the canonical comparison directly.\n- Add a narrow `openclaw/plugin-sdk/secret-display-runtime` entrypoint for Talk Voice instead of expanding the deprecated broad security barrel.\n\n## User Impact\n\nNo intended behavior change. Existing masked output remains byte-for-byte stable for covered inputs, and authentication/webhook comparisons retain exact string equality without unequal-length short-circuiting.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Focused tests: `node scripts/run-vitest.mjs src/security/secret-mask.test.ts src/security/secret-equal.test.ts extensions/talk-voice/index.test.ts extensions/browser/src/browser/server.auth-token-gates-http.test.ts extensions/voice-call/src/webhook-security.test.ts extensions/webhooks/src/http.test.ts extensions/zalo/src/monitor.webhook.test.ts` (6 shards, 100 tests)\n- SDK contract: `node --max-old-space-size=8192 --import tsx scripts/generate-plugin-sdk-api-baseline.ts --check`\n- SDK exports: `node scripts/check-plugin-sdk-subpath-exports.mjs`\n- Build + broad gate: Testbox `tbx_01kwnaydkb82mp7258mmmr1qy2`, Actions run 28690383125, `pnpm build` plus full `pnpm check:changed`\n- Exact-head broad gate: Testbox `tbx_01kwnc5bvzt0f1cq2zh7bf994h`, Actions run 28690898988, full `pnpm check:changed`\n- Autoreview: `.agents/skills/autoreview/scripts/autoreview --mode branch --base origin/main --prompt-file /tmp/secret-primitives-review.txt --stream-engine-output` — clean, no accepted/actionable findings\n- Head SHA: `98ffb0947fd529b8993574aaca1b92c7c7844415`\n",
